                <head>264. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On June 17, the Operations Coordinating Board reviewed and revised the OCB Operations Plan for Greece. The Operations Plan
                    adopted on June 17 made further minor revisions of the text of the Operations
                    Plan of May 21, 1958 (<ref target="#d241">Document 241</ref>). The text of the
                    Operations Plan adopted on June 17, which is dated June 24, is in Department of
                    State, OCB Files: Lot 62 D 430, Greece. In addition, the Board discussed the problem of
                    rising Greek defense costs. Minutes of the June 17 board meeting are <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Ibid</hi>., Minutes VII.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
